Interviews	Collecting information through direct conversations.
Structured Interview	Fixed questions.
Unstructured Interview	No fixed questions.
Semi-structured Interview	Prepared questions with additional questions.

Remember the most important flow:
Work Performance Data (WPD)

Raw facts and measurements

Work Performance Information (WPI)

Analyzed and processed data

Work Performance Reports (WPR)

Information presented to stakeholders


Easy way to remember:
- Data = Collect
- Information = Analyze
- Reports = Present
